 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "No crowd for the thousands (number left vague), no motif on death or fighting; growth for the revival, coins and wheat for the loan multiplied. 243:15 and 243:17 glosses from As-Sa'di (Muyassar's 'punishment' reading avoided). STAGING v4: 243: the people (uncountable) walk out of their town and leave the stage on 243:10, well before the decree on 243:15; their death is not shown. Hourglass plate on 243:15, a sparkle on the empty place on 243:17 (no figures, no beam). 244 (the command to fight) is its own ambient chapter (geometric, camera only, no plate). 245: a rich man gives to a poor man (the goodly loan); the camera goes to the poor man, then the rich man, on 245:13-14."
 },
